<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers traded active at $.50 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mainly Choice 2-4, 1100-1400 lbs 70.50-72.00, few blacks 72.50. Select 69.00-71.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Load Choice 2-4, 1050 lb blacks 72.50; otherwise, Select and Choice 950-1250 lbs 70.00-71.50, few 72.00.</p>
</text>
